ikipedia/page/Cosmic_Background_Explorer"}]}, "COBE launched on **November 18, 1989, at 14:34 UTC**, from Vandenberg Air Force Base in California. NASA's own science site says NASA's COBE satellite rocketed into Earth orbit on Nov. 18, 1989. NASA's archived Mather FAQ gives the same date and notes the Delta rocket lifted off from Vandenberg Air Force Base at Pt. Arguello, California.\n\nThe rocket was a Delta 5920-8, and the spacecraft was deactivated on 23 December 1993. Its instruments were shut down that month, and engineering operations were to conclude in January 1994."], "durationSeconds": 4.247995958, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01PYBFLVerL2mvbYrEVB9Hfh", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
